@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:9000
@token = <output of: python3 test/make_token.py  (signed with the Development key, valid 1 hour)>

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: text/plain

###

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/products/selectAll?page=0&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/products/export?page=0&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/checkout/create-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }],
  "customerEmail": "test@example.com",
  "customerName": "Test Customer"
}

###

POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/checkout/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "cs_test_..." }

###
